    "detailed_description": "DriveSafely is a mini-game where you can get unlimited points to control the aircraft, and the controls are very simple.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou'll need to keep your attention, dodge all moving objects and successfully pick up random hearts!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe screen you see is the only level of the game, there are no upgrades, no more levels, no tight time requirements.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nOperation mode: continuous single button: W/S/A/D respectively control the flight up and down, left and right.<br />\r\nPS: Pick up as many hearts as possible to increase your points, if you can't pick up hearts in the first place, don't worry about this, because hearts will appear in a certain position in a short period of time.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIf you want to switch the color of the scene to suit your color preference, press the keyboard: F<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIf you want to take a break during the game and keep your existing points, press the keyboard: ESC<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGame End Conditions:<br />\r\n1. Avoid hitting any moving objects!<br />\r\n2. Avoid touching the red frame at the edges!<br />\r\n3. Close the game!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPoints Requirements:<br />\r\nSuccessfully pick up hearts.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPlease note: There is no upper limit on the maximum score and the maximum number of points you earn is automatically saved!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nHave fun!",
